1072 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Some important notes from the call\072\050\050This was flagged as a direct ripoff from vibe\056co \055 fair\054 additionally Vibe did something recently with gen ai claymation style so the reference images in the deck are not landing\056\n\nClient said they felt like our creative was living in a middle space that didn\031t look totally real\054 but also didn\031t look like illustration or genAI\056 I challenged the idea of which way they wanted to swing and they unanimaously agreed that they woudl like to use this as a brand moment to lean more towards the illlustrated side\056 \n\nI\031m envisioning this living room scene\054 looking as if it\031s an apartment inside of Roku city with the one caveat\054 we cannot actually use any of the main graphics from the brand kit unless we want this runup like 47 layers of brand approval\056 So think in the space of creating a flat licing room scene that looks out on Roku city\054 in silhoette\056\n\nLet\031s lean into the purples but also keep this light\056\n\nI personally don\031t think that the living room table items need to change\054 but would love to see the brand represented ON the television screen\054\n\nAnimation direction\072 Headline mainly plus the TV screen \055 would be awesome to do some subtle keyframing in the foreground or background to add a layer of quality but I\031ll leave that up to you\n)
     /K [ 34 ]
     /P 1073 0 R
     /Pg 1004 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

